1dNpaNkB6bzLhtvBXr5etipY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAP3PSrlalO3HRA2HRK692heIGsDSsT1DWfQx1xO1_Ubw&oe=6A5CE020"}, "display_name": "SkydiveSim", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SkydiveSim brings the thrill of skydiving and BASE jumping to your Oculus Quest headset. No more waiting on weather on bad weather days. Put on your headset and choose from our gorgeous levels. Jump from a plane 10,000 feet above ground. Challenge yourself to go through the free fall rings. Then pull your ripcord and fly under the canopy and finally work on your accuracy and  land on the target. You don't need a plane ride back up, just repeat in the same scene or choose another one of our exotics environments to jump into.\nWant even more  excitement? BASE jump from top of the buildings, windmills and light towers, pull the ripcord and navigate to the ground!", "short_description": "SkydiveSim brings the thrill of skydiving and BASE jumping to your Oculus Quest headset.\nThis is the full version of the game and it includes extra environments and well as the ability to jump from a helicopter,  balloon as well as BASE jumping from windmills and light towers!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/privacy/view/130ff4c1b0687c52ebc5095cc923e4f6", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/terms/view/37b5278e52fb6c7b0e5aee1fbc17d2b2", "publisher_name": "AV1 Productions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.skydivesim.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "SIMULATION", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "452790896554314"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 18, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1367317508695363"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1897940734236381"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1335957508440501"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1454593749484301"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "911946071676503"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4386253488365143"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "850044404609302"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1171582327990692"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "705789479199257"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "758359823361270"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1407005983906431"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1167867321804748"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1797117851064646"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558672247163105"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1561625437787896"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "661102699417392"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1213129326298038"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "367175005230199"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1407005983906431"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786726800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1367317508695363"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25870246609340349", "version": "4.9.7"}, "id": "337947788184196", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25870246609340349"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Skydive Sim now includes several new beta features designed to bring more real-world data and awareness into each jump.\n\nReal-world location wind and gust data can now be pulled from the selected Google Earth location to drive in-game wind conditions. \n\nCanopy customization has also been upgraded with real-world-style inputs, including canopy type, body weight, gear weight, canopy size, exit weight, and wing loading.\n\nThe minimap now displays AI skydivers and remote multiplayer players with live altitude readouts, giving you better awareness of who is around you in the sky.\n\nOther notable beta additions include layered wind by altitude, multiplayer wind sync from the session host, improved canopy wind drift based on wing loading, and yellow minimap markers for AI skydivers.", "created_date": 1783044507, "id": "25870246609340349", "version": "4.9.7", "version_code": 237, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25870238012674542"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25870246609340349"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Skydive Sim now includes several new beta features designed to bring more real-world data and awareness into each jump.\n\nReal-world location wind and gust data can now be pulled from the selected Google Earth location to drive in-game wind conditions. \n\nCanopy customization has also been upgraded with real-world-style inputs, including canopy type, body weight, gear weight, canopy size, exit weight, and wing loading.\n\nThe minimap now displays AI skydivers and remote multiplayer players with live altitude readouts, giving you better awareness of who is around you in the sky.\n\nOther notable beta additions include layered wind by altitude, multiplayer wind sync from the session host, improved canopy wind drift based on wing loading, and yellow minimap markers for AI skydivers.", "created_date": 1782861298, "id": "25846981128333564", "version": "4.9.6", "version_code": 236, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25846726658359011"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25870246609340349"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782234594, "id": "25765837413114603", "version": "4.9.5", "version_code": 235, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25765722916459386"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25870246609340349"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Skydiving Logbook and Explore Mode Added\n\nThis update adds two new features to Skydive Sim:\n\nSkydiving Logbook\nTrack your jumps with the new Skydiving Logbook. Your jumps are now saved locally so you can review your jump history, locations, details, and notes over time.\n\nExplore Mode\nExplore Mode is now available. Fly freely through Google Earth locations without the normal skydiving gameplay mechanics. It\u2019s a more relaxed way to discover landmarks, scout locations, and experience the world from above.\n\nAdditional improvements and fixes are included to improve the overall experience.", "created_date": 1781709117, "id": "25694323476932664", "version": "4.9.4", "version_code": 234, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25694233793608299"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25870246609340349"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Skydiving Logbook and Explore Mode Added\n\nThis update adds two new features to Skydive Sim:\n\nSkydiving Logbook\nTrack your jumps with the new Skydiving Logbook. Your jumps are now saved locally so you can review your jump history, locations, details, and notes over time.\n\nExplore Mode\nExplore Mode is now available. Fly freely through Google Earth locations without the normal skydiving gameplay mechanics. It\u2019s a more relaxed way to discover landmarks, scout locations, and experience the world from above.\n\nAdditional improvements and fixes are included to improve the overall experience.", "created_date": 1781459143, "id": "25660017973696548", "version": "4.9.3", "version_code": 233, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25659920987039580"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}